Task ID
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\\fB\\-\\-priority\\fR \\fIstring\\fR
Priority level. Default: medium. Choices: low, medium, high
.TP
\\fB\\-\\-[no\\-]verbose\\fR \\fIboolean\\fR
Show detailed information
"
`;
